{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgOZVIIiz4h0UQuWZDKBO","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I'm working through a mobile finance app design in a 375×812 canvas: 6 frames named 01_Get_Started, 02_Home, 03_Wallet, 04_Add_Card, 05_Payment, 06_Receipt, with brand #007AFF, ink #1A1A1F, secondary #6B6B76, tertiary #9A9AA6, surface #F5F5F7, border #E8E8ED and white page background. Since screenshots come back only as URLs and I have no image-viewing tool here, I work from the metadata alone, which already carries enough detail.\n\nI start with shared building blocks so the system stays consistent: a primary button at 335×56, radius 16, #007AFF fill with white 16 SemiBold label, in Default, Pressed (#0062CC) and Disabled (#E8E8ED with #A0A0AA text) states; a ghost text button; and a field with a 13 SemiBold label over a 48-high input, radius 12, #F5F5F7 fill, in Default, Focused, Filled and FocusedFilled variants (the last one blue 2px border on white). A header component at 375×56 centers an 18 SemiBold title with optional back and action slots. A transaction row at 335×64 pairs a 40px icon circle with a 15 SemiBold merchant name, 12 secondary date and a right-aligned amount.\n\n01_Get_Started: the logo at 24,72 (181×24), the 240×160 illustration at x=67.5, y=180, a 28/36 SemiBold headline at a 24 margin from y=410, the 343×56 button at x=16, y=700, and the home indicator at y=778.\n\n02_Home: a \"HOME\" eyebrow at 11 SemiBold, \"Hello, Maria\" at 26 with a 48px avatar at x=311, y=52, then a 335×132 blue gradient balance card at y=120 holding \"My Balance\" and $25,520.00 with a chevron. The expenses card sits at y=268, 190 high, with an SVG curve across MAR–AUG and JUN highlighted showing $80.40. Three rows begin at y=506 at 68 spacing: Nike Air Max 2090 (15 Aug 2020, −$243.00), iPad Pro 2020 (10 Aug 2020, −$799.00), Uber (5 Mar 2020, +$50.00). A 56px plus FAB lands at x=311, y=726.\n\n03_Wallet: back icon, centered \"Wallet\", add-card icon at x=323. The Visa card is 295×186 at x=20, y=104 over the coral texture, with the white Mastercard-free Visa mark, BALANCE $25,520.00, 4225 9765 0008 6141, MARIA LOPEZ and EXPIRY 09/24, plus a peeking next card at x=327. Dots at y=302, a promo card with the POPULAR badge at y=330, and rows from y=492.\n\n04_Add_Card: a dimmed #1A1A1F 0.35 overlay, then the sheet from y=72 with a 36×4 grabber, \"Add new card\" header with a close icon, a 303×190 Mastercard preview showing 5412 7534 0089 2216, and four fields from y=356 at 68 rhythm; the card number field is FocusedFilled with the Mastercard mark inside. The 56-high button sits at y=690.\n\n05_Payment: Cancel at left, \"Payment\" centered, $50.00 at 44, a PAYING row with Robert Dawson's avatar, a reused card at \"1 of 3\", an \"Add a note\" field at y=530, Pay now at y=640 and Cancel text at y=706.\n\n06_Receipt: a 327×560 card at x=24, y=104 with CASH RECEIPT, 20.08.2020, Amount $40.00, Service Fee $2.82, Internet Charge $7.18, a dashed divider, Total $50.00, a 254×68 barcode and a Home button at y=700.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":38537,"input_tokens":1,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":38537}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"06e568f0-e8d8-4a4c-a52f-32c2c35f5d7f","uuid":"c260ef0f-f7f4-416a-89e1-2be676666473","timestamp":"2026-11-02T07:55:13.834Z","thinking_duration_ms":108113}
