{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgOZv4rnp9T3rFkpDvoUA","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to lay out and describe the 6 app screens on a canvas at 375x812 with 470 spacing: 01_Get_Started at (0,0), 02_Home at (450,0), 03_Wallet at (900,0), 04_Add_Card at (1350,0), 05_Payment at (1800,0), 06_Receipt at (2250,0). I build them in maybe 2 calls with shared helpers.\n\nFor 01_Get_Started I use a white background (#FFFFFF) with a soft blue gradient blob at the top, a Status bar with dark glyphs, a centered logo at y=88, a 300x200 illustration at y=190, and the headline as one 26px/34 text node containing \"Going cashless has never been easier with the world's leading expense manager.\" I place a Get Started button at y = 812-34-24-56 = 698.\n\nFor 02_Home I stack a Status bar (44), greeting header with \"Hello, Maria\" and a 44x44 avatar clipped to cornerRadius 22, a balance card, a 200px expenses chart, a Wallet section header with \"See all\", 3 transaction rows at 192 total, and a floating blue + button. The total comes to about 710, which fits in 812 without scroll. In the header I keep the plus icon as the new payment entry point, and \"See all\" links elsewhere.\n\nFor 03_Wallet I use a back icon, \"Wallet\" title, add card icon, a 335x200 payment card at y≈76, a \"1 of 3\" indicator, a promo, then 3 rows; the sum is 44+56+200+16+116+24+40+192 = 688.\n\n01, 02, and 03 hold at these heights.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"output_tokens":0,"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation_input_tokens":58535,"input_tokens":1,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":58535}},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"06e568f0-e8d8-4a4c-a52f-32c2c35f5d7f","uuid":"27730b22-8db1-462e-9bdd-58cb24f74b50","timestamp":"2026-11-02T07:59:08.95