{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011Cgdl2sUxmKoelvkzQaouj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking me to fix overlap and layout issues across several screens. On 02_Home, the FAB at y=678 overlaps the row ending at y=716, so I resize it to 48px at x=307, y=724 with a 14x14 plus icon at 17,17, keeping it above the home indicator at 778. On 06_Receipt, the \"Total\" label at y=212 collides with the paid note at y=216, so I move the paid note to y=238 within the 412 card height. In the MiniCard component, the count right-aligned at 319 overlaps the chevron at x=296, so I set the count to 285 and the chevron to 305. On 04_Add_Card, the help icon moves to x=44, and the sheet starts at y=130 with height 682, the button at y=568 (absolute 698-754) and the secure text at y=628 (absolute 758, below the home bar area).","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5133,"cache_read_input_tokens":101429,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5133,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"06e568f0-e8d8-4a4c-a52f-32c2c35f5d7f","uuid":"5fa34fe9-1148-499d-bb5b-d8ffc80bbdd8","timestamp":"2026-11-02T08:08:31.007Z","thinking_duration_ms":9442}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011Cgdl2sUxmKoelvkzQaouj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Fixes needed: the Home FAB covers the Uber amount, the receipt \"Total\" label collides with the paid note, the payment card's \"1 of 3\" collides with its chevron, and the add-card sheet sits too low. All independent, so one pass."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5133,"cache_read_input_tokens":101429,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5133,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"06e568f0-e8d8-4a4c-a52f-32c2c35f5d7f","uuid":"91f4ca78-c866-4bcb-8b12-697c2ebe08b6","timestamp":"2026-11-02T08:08:31.010Z"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011Cgdl2sUxmKoelvkzQaouj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01HfPdyHMzIS8ITR6DAbVeLh","name":"mcp__figma__use_figma","input":{"code":"const page = await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('8:2');\nawait figma.setCurrentPageAsync(page);\nconst out={};\n\n// A. 02_Home FAB: shrink and move below rows\nconst s2=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('14:175');\nconst fab=s2.children.find(c=>c.name==='New payment');\nif(fab){ fab.resize(48,48); fab.cornerRadius=24; fab.x=307; fab.y=724;\n  const p=fab.children[0]; if(p){ p.resize(16,16); p.x=16; p.y=16; }\n  out.fab='moved';\n}\n// B. MiniCard: separate count from chevron\nconst mini=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('13:36');\nif(mini){\n  const cnt=mini.children.find(c=>c.type==='TEXT'&&c.name==='Count');\n  const chev=mini.children.find(c=>c.type==='INSTANCE');\n  if(chev) chev.x=303;\n  if(cnt) cnt.x=283-cnt.width;\n  out.mini=[cnt&&cnt.x, chev&&chev.x];\n}\n// C. Receipt: move paid note below Total label\nconst rc=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('13:69');\nif(rc){ const pn=rc.children.find(c=>c.name==='PaidNote'); if(pn){pn.y=238;} out.receipt=pn&&pn.y; }\n// D. Add card sheet: raise, tighten footer, fix help icon\nconst s4=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync('17:211');\nconst sheet=s4.children.find(c=>c.name==='Sheet');\nif(sheet){ sheet.y=130; sheet.resize(375,682); }\nconst sec=sheet.children.find(c=>c.name==='Secure'); if(sec) sec.y=628;\nconst help=sheet.children.find(c=>c.type==='INSTANCE'&&c.name==='IconButton / Help'); if(help) help.x=46;\nout.sheet=sheet&&[sheet.y,sheet.height,sec&&sec.y,help&&help.x];\n\n// E. re-audit bounds\nconst audit={};\nfor(const [k,id] of Object.entries({'01':'14:152','02':'14:175','03':'17:134','04':'17:211','05':'17:312','06':'17:358'})){\n  const f=await figma.getNodeByIdAsync(id);\n  audit[k]=f.children.filter(c=>c.x+c.width>375.5||c.y+c.height>812.5||c.x<-0.5).map(c=>c.name);\n}\nreturn JSON.stringify({out,audit});","description":"Fix FAB overlap, receipt note, mini card count, sheet position","fileKey":"srtKMfdMQueLXSGicHfAT9"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":9,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5133,"cache_read_input_tokens":101429,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":5133,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"06e568f0-e8d8-4a4c-a52f-32c2c35f5d7f","uuid":"1f4774af-fabf-404d-a8eb-39ffa7c74d81","timestamp":"2026-11-02T08:08:31.615Z","tool_use_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01HfPdyHMzIS8ITR6DAbVeLh","display_name":"Use Figma","server_display_name":"figma-authenticated-proxy","tool_name":"use_figma"}]}
