{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5-1","id":"msg_011CgdmVZ8uPdXxyJYXyfVbG","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Nothing is left to request: the library render is the last verification I needed, and it shows the Header variants (0/72/144), transaction rows, card components, chart, promo and receipt all laid out without overlap. The build is complete, so here is the delivery report.\n\n**File and page**\n\n- File: https://www.figma.com/design/srtKMfdMQueLXSGicHfAT9/\n- `03 · Workspace` page ID: `8:2`\n- Account used: gaoyongyong@tetras.ai (confirmed with whoami)\n- Reference pages `00`, `01`, `02` and `04` were left untouched; all delivery work is inside the empty workspace.\n\n**Screens** (375 × 812, light mode, laid out left to right on the page)\n\n| Frame | Node ID |\n|---|---|\n| 01_Get_Started | `14:152` |\n| 02_Home | `14:175` |\n| 03_Wallet | `17:134` |\n| 04_Add_Card | `17:211` |\n| 05_Payment | `17:312` |\n| 06_Receipt | `17:358` |\n\n**Design system and components** (library frame `11:2`)\n\n- Button / Primary with Default, Pressed and Disabled variants, plus Button / Ghost.\n- Field with Default, Focused and Filled variants, using the given Text Field styling as the base.\n- Header variants, seven IconButton variants and three TransactionRow variants.\n- Business components: BalanceCard, PaymentCard, MiniCard, ExpensesChart, PromoCard, ReceiptCard and NewCardPreview.\n\nScreen elements are instances of these, not redrawn copies. Media from `04 · Media` (logo, illustration, coral texture, promo art, both avatars, three merchant marks, Visa and Mastercard, barcode, icons) is placed as instances and recolored where the brief permits.\n\n**States covered**\n\n- Focused and filled card-number field with Mastercard detected inside the field, and a Mastercard preview card showing only the typed number.\n- Current card in the wallet: full-size Visa card with page dots marking card 1 of 3, plus a sliver of the next card.\n- Highlighted chart point: JUN on a dashed guide with an `$80.40` tooltip.\n- Sheet presentation: the wallet visible and dimmed behind the Add new card sheet, with grabber and close control.\n\n**Prototype** — 12 click interactions, all verified on the nodes\n\n- Get Started leads to 02_Home.\n- Home: balance card and See all lead to 03_Wallet; the blue plus button leads to 05_Payment.\n- Wallet: back leads to 02_Home; add card leads to 04_Add_Card.\n- Add card: close and Add new card both lead to 03_Wallet.\n- Payment: Pay now leads to 06_Receipt; both Cancel controls lead to 02_Home.\n- Receipt: Home leads to 02_Home.\n- Flow starting point is set on 01_Get_Started as \"Expenio · Main flow\".\n\n**Limitations**\n\n- Two deliberate additions beyond the must-include lists: a notification button on Home and a \"Payment successful\" confirmation on the receipt. Both are decoration and change no required content.\n- Home and Wallet are built to fit 812 without scrolling, though the brief allows them to scroll.\n- The QR/barcode and chart curve are vector recreations from the supplied assets and a hand-built path, not the original exports."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":4,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":137193,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"06e568f0-e8d8-4a4c-a52f-32c2c35f5d7f","uuid":"4eb14ad3-caf4-4fbb-b050-80ea2feb0e3f","timestamp":"2026-11-02T08:14:57.271Z"}
